        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MDH30, 3\" Solid Brass Magnetic Door Stop and Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere are 2 main sections to this magnetic door stop. The 3\" long base section has a permanent magnet on the end. You can vertically mount it to the floor or horizontally mount it to the wall or baseboard. The small round receptor section is screwed to the door and is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. Both sections of the magnetic door stop offer concealed screw mounting for an elegant installation. It is packaged complete with mounting anchors and screws for easy installation. The 3 Inch Magnetic Door Stop is made of solid brass construction to last and available in 9 great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MDH30.gif?v=1704354738\" width\"530\" height=\"218\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Solid Brass 3 Inch Magnetic Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-1-2-inch-heavy-duty-magnetic-door-stop-deltana-mdh35\"><b>Heavy Duty Magnetic Door Stop</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\nAlso see our <a href=\"/pages/magnetic-door-stops-and-holders\"><b>Magnetic Door Stops</b></a> tech page for more information and ideas.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana MDH30  Magnetic Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Bottom Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Receptor Height: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Receptor Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MDH30.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  MDH30 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 3 Inch Magnetic Door Stop",
                "description": "3 Inch Solid Brass Magnetic Door Stop and Holder, Deltana MDH30 - There are 2 main sections to this magnetic door stop. The 3 inch long base section has a permanent magnet on the end. It can vertically mount it to the floor or horizontally mount it to the wall or baseboard. The small round receptor section is screwed to the door and is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. Both sections of the magnetic door stop offer concealed screw mounting for an elegant installation. It is packaged complete with mounting anchors and screws for easy installation. The 3 Inch Magnetic Door Stop is made of solid brass construction to last and available in 9 great finishes.",
